1
00:00:00,558 --> 00:00:02,868
(Howard:)she could literally sleep
with his own father in his own bed

2
00:00:03,027 --> 00:00:05,697
(Howard:)and post the video to YouTube,
and he'd still buy her flowers

3
00:00:05,863 --> 00:00:07,773
(Howard:)and ask her to be his bride.

4
00:00:10,969 --> 00:00:12,039
(Raj:)He's right.

5
00:00:14,973 --> 00:00:16,953
But in my defense,
if we could survive that,

6
00:00:17,108 --> 00:00:18,648
(Raj:)we could survive anything.

7
00:00:20,645 --> 00:00:22,625
(Bernadette:)Well, if you're sure you want
to do this, it's only coffee.

8
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,950
(Bernadette:)Just relax and see what happens.

9
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:27,830
(Raj:)-Well, can I say she looks nice?
-Sure.

10
00:00:27,986 --> 00:00:29,486
(Raj:)Can I tell her I miss her?

11
00:00:29,654 --> 00:00:31,494
(Bernadette:)Maybe, if she asks.

12
00:00:31,656 --> 00:00:33,396
(Raj:)Can I show her
an oil painting I made of us

13
00:00:33,558 --> 00:00:35,968
(Raj:)surrounded by our children
and grandchildren?

14
00:00:38,496 --> 00:00:40,976
(Bernadette:)I'd save that for the second date.

15
00:00:41,132 --> 00:00:43,802
(Raj:)Good, good,
'cause no matter how hard I try,

16
00:00:43,968 --> 00:00:46,418
I cannot get the twins to lock alike.

17
00:00:53,011 --> 00:00:54,011
(Penny:)What are you doing?

18
00:00:54,178 --> 00:00:56,848
(Leonard:)Oh, I'm just trying to find
the stupid next of kin

19
00:00:57,015 --> 00:01:00,185
(Leonard:)to this stupid video store owner,
so I can return the DVD

